nd-Assisted Leg Lowering","description":"Podignuti nogu što je moguće više održavajući je opruženui relaksiranu bez savianja kolena. U tom položaju pasivno je održavati gumom Suprotnu nogu spuštati do rolera održavajući leđa i karlicu u neutralnom položaju. U završnom položaju pritisnuti roler. Što je moguće višu poziciju gornje noge zauzeti ali da se ovaj pokret može pravilno izvesti. POkušati i dodatno podići gornju nogu tokom pritiska rolera.","short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1MPwNbQiRuEAq2evpZci6CQlzXvVCXEzo","video_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/19PfhL8bv7-VjMtD4ucBobYAbjjR2l3Qp/view?usp=drivesdk","sets":"1","reps":"5L","load":null,"item_order":"3","exercise_order":"3","source_row_ref":"2566","domain_name":null,"category_name":"General Prep","section_name":"Mobility/stability1","domain_color":null,"category_color":"#a4c2f4","section_color":"#fff2cc","domain_icon_url":null,"category_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1c9jBrmpSHHKcYbsRsIYs_gDM6XkYN7UO/view?usp=drive_link","section_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gx1gj-O-yHh6_HgkCvP6B4rHK6l3CVir/view?usp=drive_link","domain_short_note":null,"category_short_note":null,"section_short_note":null,"domain_note":null,"category_note":null,"section_note":null,"domain_order":null,"category_order":"1","section_order":"1","exercise_key_type":"code","exercise_key":"1088","exercise_expected_name":"Band-Assisted Leg Lowering"},{"plan_source_ref":"zija-murina-131-cleaned-2026-08-18:weekly:2026-06-08","date":"2026-06-08","session_order":"1","node_type":"section","node_name":"Mobility/stability2","node_order":"2","item_type":"exercise","title":"Dijagonalni dohvat rukom i nogom","description":"Stabilan položaj trupa i tela. Skočni, koleno, kuk, rame u istoj ravni. Leđa neutralna, glava u produžetku tela","short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1RZAs1SH21Ibi9ViZPWcl1kBXZi_GO2dN","video_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oaZE9fg7