h nogu"},{"plan_source_ref":"zija-murina-131-cleaned-2026-08-18:weekly:2026-07-27","date":"2026-07-27","session_order":"1","node_type":"section","node_name":"Mobility","node_order":"1","item_type":"exercise","title":"Brettzel 2.0","description":"Postavi se u bočni sedeći položaj tako da su prednja butina i ramena paralelni.\r\n\r\nIz tog položaja polako rotiraj trup napred-nazad ka strani donjeg kuka i vraćaj se u početni položaj. Tokom pokreta fokusiraj se na rotaciju grudnog dela leđa, a ne samo na pomeranje ramena..","short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1egGLJbf9WDolA5e4AoQ3k8j1LtkKULAp/view?usp=drive_link","video_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LdiVNTF9PimFNbI_Ocs_IJJYSmdFVGX9/view?usp=sharing","sets":"1","reps":"20+20s","load":null,"item_order":"2","exercise_order":"2","source_row_ref":"2669","domain_name":null,"category_name":"Mobility","section_name":"Mobility","domain_color":null,"category_color":"#6aa84f","section_color":"#6aa84f","domain_icon_url":null,"category_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1d4ebsgqCt-4CkTqbBV_FCV_POIuY5cJs/view?usp=drive_link","section_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1d4ebsgqCt-4CkTqbBV_FCV_POIuY5cJs/view?usp=drive_link","domain_short_note":null,"category_short_note":null,"section_short_note":null,"domain_note":null,"category_note":null,"section_note":null,"domain_order":null,"category_order":"1","section_order":"1","exercise_key_type":"code","exercise_key":"1180","exercise_expected_name":"Brettzel 2.0"},{"plan_source_ref":"zija-murina-131-cleaned-2026-08-18:weekly:2026-07-27","date":"2026-07-27","session_order":"1","node_type":"section","node_name":"Warming up","node_order":"1","item_type":"exercise","title":"Band-Assisted Leg Lowering","description":"Podignuti nogu što je moguće više održavajući je opruženui relaksiranu bez savianja kolena. U tom položaju pasivno je održavati gumom Suprotnu nogu spuštati do rolera održavajući leđa i karlicu u neutralnom položaju. U završnom položaju pritisnuti roler. Što je moguće višu poziciju gornje noge zauzeti ali da se ovaj pokret može pravilno izvesti. POkušati i dodatno podići gornju nogu tokom pritiska rolera.","short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1MPwNbQiRuEAq2evpZci6CQlzXvVCXEzo","video_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/19PfhL8bv7-VjMtD4ucBobYAbjjR2l3Qp/view?usp=drivesdk","sets":"1","reps":"5L","load":null,"item_order":"3","exercise_order":"3","source_row_ref":"2657","domain_name":null,"category_name":"Strenght Arms&Core","section_name":"Warming up","domain_color":null,"category_color":"#f9cb9c","section_color":"#b6d7a8","domain_icon_url":null,"category_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BdkIAwNBBpDZbnE77LVDF7Z55P9G7s3U/view?usp=drive_link","section_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1dTnx8f6xoEwLKBtxXVeORU__GChS1f6h/view?usp=drive_link","domain_short_note":null,"category_short_note":null,"section_short_note":null,"domain_note":null,"category_note":null,"section_note":null,"domain_order":null,"category_order":"1","section_order":"1","exercise_key_type":"code","exercise_key":"1088","exercise_expected_name":"Band-Assisted Leg Lowering"},{"plan_source_ref":"zija-murina-131-cleaned-2026-08-18:weekly:2026-07-27","date":"2026-07-27","session_order":"1","node_type":"section","node_name":"Mobility","node_order":"1","item_type":"exercise","title":"Brettzel 2.0 sa otklonom u stranu - FUL PROGRESIJA","description":"Tokom vežbe obavezno je nomalno disanje. Povećavanjem amplitude može doći do poremećaja disanja i tonusa. To je znak da treba stati, vratiti se malo unazad, udahnuti i tokom kontrolisanog i sporog izdisanja povećati amplitudu do sledeće izazovne pozicije. Kada više nema povećavanja, zadržati tu poziciju 20s. Voditi računa da tokom cele vežbe bude normalno disanje. Ruka koja je oslonac sve vreme opružena. Suprotno rame postaviti ka napred u liniji sa ramenom ruke koja je oslonac.","short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https: