anu - FUL PROGRESIJA","description":"Tokom vežbe obavezno je nomalno disanje. Povećavanjem amplitude može doći do poremećaja disanja i tonusa. To je znak da treba stati, vratiti se malo unazad, udahnuti i tokom kontrolisanog i sporog izdisanja povećati amplitudu do sledeće izazovne pozicije. Kada više nema povećavanja, zadržati tu poziciju 20s. Voditi računa da tokom cele vežbe bude normalno disanje. Ruka koja je oslonac sve vreme opružena. Suprotno rame postaviti ka napred u liniji sa ramenom ruke koja je oslonac.","short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1TIGSvRbyUpgAgMCzcN9sfbGObqgHkddB","video_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/18oye3Pr0y0YByMWiG0YI6ZafwiZSR_A0/view?usp=sharing","sets":"1","reps":"20+20s","load":null,"item_order":"2","exercise_order":"2","source_row_ref":"2639","domain_name":null,"category_name":null,"section_name":"Mobility","domain_color":null,"category_color":null,"section_color":"#6aa84f","domain_icon_url":null,"category_icon_url":null,"section_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1d4ebsgqCt-4CkTqbBV_FCV_POIuY5cJs/view?usp=drive_link","domain_short_note":null,"category_short_note":null,"section_short_note":null,"domain_note":null,"category_note":null,"section_note":null,"domain_order":null,"category_order":null,"section_order":"1","exercise_key_type":"code","exercise_key":"473","exercise_expected_name":"Brettzel 2.0 sa otklonom u stranu - FUL PROGRESIJA"},{"plan_source_ref":"zija-murina-131-cleaned-2026-08-18:weekly:2026-08-03","date":"2026-08-08","session_order":"1","node_type":"section","node_name":"Mobility","node_order":"1","item_type":"exercise","title":"Asistirano spuštanje opružene noge + gluteus aktivacija + dodatna kontrakcija (odvajanje) noge","description":"Place the injured leg on a wall or other solid object such as a door frame so the other leg can move freely up and down\r\nSet the angle of the raised leg according to ability\r\nExtend the leg against the wall and actively pull the foot toward the body so the heel is higher than the toes\r\nLower and raise the other extended leg in sync with breathing\r\nIn the bottom position, activate the glute, lift the body off the floor if possible, and hold for 3 seconds\r\nFurther contract the top leg so it lifts away from the wall if possible\r\nKeep the knee and foot extended and pulled toward the body with the heel higher than the toes","short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1N3oSNwFTu69CurWgFkU-3mp9vqOBE5a3","video_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NyMs3CHNY2MsK1bzWe9XgL7_JTFNgI9y/view?usp=drive_link","sets":"1","reps":"8+8","load":null,"item_order":"3","exercise_order":"3","source_row_ref":"2640","domain_name":null,"category_name":null,"section_name":"Mobility","domain_color":null,"category_color":null,"section_color":"#6aa84f","domain_icon_url":null,"category_icon_url":null,"section_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1d4ebsgqCt-4CkTqbBV_FCV_POIuY5cJs/view?usp=drive_link","domain_short_note":null,"category_short_note":null,"section_short_note":null,"domain_note":null,"category_note":null,"section_note":null,"domain_order":null,"category_order":null,"section_order":"1","exercise_key_type":"code","exercise_key":"1139","exercise_expected_name":"Asistirano spuštanje opružene noge + gluteus aktivacija + dodatna kontrakcija (odvajanje) noge"},{"plan_source_ref":"zija-murina-131-cleaned-2026-08-18:weekly:2026-08-03","date":"2026-08-08","session_order":"1","node_type":"section","node_name":"Mobility","node_order":"1","item_type":"exercise","title":"Opružanje leđa na klupici oslonjen jednom nogom i trupom sa pregibanjem u zglobu kolena uz asistenciju partnera","description":null,"short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1Ad1s8dne-wMPpk7Nr89QrY7Le8GtquBX","video_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wVtey4pFaE3XkfzJORv0DLnx1jR5WMt9/view?usp=sharing","sets":"1","reps":"20+20s","load":null,"item_order":"4","exercise_order":"4","sourc